# Blog Application

## Features
- View all blog posts
- View individual posts
- Create posts (authenticated users only)
- Edit and delete posts (author only)

## Permissions
- Anyone can read posts
- Only logged-in users can create posts
- Only post authors can edit or delete posts

## Tech Stack
- Django
- Class-Based Views
- ModelForms
- Django Authentication

## Notes
- Author is automatically assigned from the logged-in user
- Unauthorized access returns a 403 Forbidden response

## Comment System

### Features
- Users can view comments on blog posts
- Authenticated users can add comments
- Only the comment author can edit or delete their comment

### URLs
- Add comment: `/posts/<post_id>/comments/new/`
- Edit comment: `/comments/<comment_id>/edit/`
- Delete comment: `/comments/<comment_id>/delete/`

### Permissions
- Anyone can view comments
- Only logged-in users can add comments
- Only the comment author can edit or delete comments

### Data Handling
- Comment author is set automatically from the logged-in user
- Comment is always linked to a specific post
- Deleting a post deletes its related comments

